            "displayName": "Pierre Smits",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Amsterdam"
          },
          "body": "Hi [~mridulpathak],\r\n\r\nConfiguring the *Invoice ID Prefix* (field invoiceIdPrefix) in the accounting preferences separates sales invoice numbering from supplier invoice sequences.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, enabling the *{{useInvoiceIdForReturns}}* field should ensure that customer sales returns and generated credit notes maintain a continuous, sequential ID in line with sales invoices.",
